WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.813
Hi, friends. This is the Repair Kit.

00:00:12.813 --> 00:00:17.625
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:20.513
Hands flat on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:20.513 --> 00:00:23.401
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:23.401 --> 00:00:33.026
Everybody makes mistakes — grown-ups too. A mistake is not the end of the story.

00:00:33.026 --> 00:00:44.577
Five tools are in the kit: notice it, name what happened, say sorry, offer a fix, try again.

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:54.202
Let's practice with a pretend moment: reaching across the table, you knock a friend's crayons over. Down they roll, everywhere.

00:00:54.202 --> 00:01:01.902
First tool — notice. Your face might feel warm. Something in you knows: that was me.

00:01:01.902 --> 00:01:07.677
Second tool — name what happened, quietly, to yourself: "I knocked the crayons over."

00:01:07.677 --> 00:01:15.378
Third tool — say sorry in simple words, out loud: "I'm sorry I knocked your crayons over."

00:01:15.378 --> 00:01:23.078
Fourth tool — offer a fix: "I'll help you pick them up." And you gather them together.

00:01:23.078 --> 00:01:30.778
Fifth tool — try again. Next time, reach slowly — or ask: "Could you pass the crayons?"

00:01:30.778 --> 00:01:40.404
One more repair. Pretend you grabbed the red crayon from a friend's hand, because you wanted it.

00:01:40.404 --> 00:01:46.179
Run the kit. Notice — your hands grabbed before your words could ask.

00:01:46.179 --> 00:01:50.992
Name it quietly: "I grabbed the crayon." Say sorry: "I'm sorry."

00:01:50.992 --> 00:01:55.804
Offer a fix: hand it back. "You finish first. I'll wait."

00:01:55.804 --> 00:02:01.580
Try again: next time, your words ask first: "Can I use it when you're done?"

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:08.317
Notice. Name it. Say sorry. Offer a fix. Try again. That is the Repair Kit.

00:02:08.317 --> 00:02:15.055
A repair doesn't erase the mistake. It tells your friend: you matter more than my mistake.

00:02:15.055 --> 00:02:18.905
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:22.756
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:22.756 --> 00:02:26.606
You're ready for what's next.
